positions.description:
At the time Apollo GraphQL was called "Meteor Development Group" and I worked on the product that predates the current GraphQL product.

Worked on a variety of features for the Meteor open-source web development framework. The work included: efficient real-time synchronization from the database (following the replication log); front-end reactive templating; assets pipeline build system; mobile support via Apache Cordova;

During summer 2016 worked on Apollo Client and Server - open-source libraries for building GraphQL compatible servers and front-ends. Worked on core features such as mutations, optimistic UI, pagination, supporting media materials, blogposts, documentation and diagrams.

